---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="September 2026">
  <p>
    {site.legalName} respects your privacy. This policy explains what information this website handles and how it is
    used.
  </p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    This website is a static site and does not use cookies, tracking pixels or analytics. Our hosting provider may log
    standard technical information (such as IP address, browser type and pages requested) for security and operational
    purposes.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us via our enquiry form, the details you submit (name, email and message) are processed by our form
    provider, Typeform, and used only to respond to your enquiry. We do not sell or share this information with third
    parties for marketing.
  </p>
  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to external sites, including LinkedIn and portfolio company websites, are governed by those sites' own privacy
    policies.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information you have provided to us by contacting
    us through the enquiry form.
  </p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above indicates the latest revision.</p>
</Legal>
